# Bot #3: 1Hour RSI-14 55/45 plain — no trend MA, no volume, no HTF filter.
# Picked by the 2026-07-13 RTH-rules re-sweep ('EXP swpRTH1h' rows in
# backtest_results.csv): positive on every symbol in BOTH walk-forward
# windows at COST_BPS=5 (train +8.9%, test +4.5%, test-min +4.1%, ~44
# trades/yr), on a plateau of similar neighbors. Prior config p21 60/40 was
# chosen by the 2026-07-12 all-hours sweep, whose evidence did not survive
# the RTH_ONLY correction (rank 218/432, train c5 +0.9%); swapped
# 2026-07-13 before the bot's first trade. Earlier: p14 60/40 + 1Day MA50.
# Copy to 1hour.env and fill in keys (use a DIFFERENT paper account or a
# non-overlapping SYMBOLS basket — bots sharing an account fight over
# positions).
ALPACA_API_KEY=paper_account_key_here
ALPACA_SECRET_KEY=paper_account_secret_here
ALPACA_PAPER=true
TIMEFRAME=1Hour
SYMBOLS=QQQ,GLD,IWM,SPY
# 25% of current equity per position: with 4 symbols this is fully invested
# when everything signals. Reset the paper account to $2,000 so sizing
# mimics the planned live account ($500 slots that compound with equity).
NOTIONAL_PCT=25
RSI_PERIOD=14
RSI_BUY_LEVEL=55
RSI_SELL_LEVEL=45
TREND_MA_PERIOD=0
VOLUME_MULT=0
HTF_MA_PERIOD=0
POLL_SECONDS=1800
TRADES_DB=/opt/rsi-midline-bot/trades-1hour.db
